<title>USA: Suiza completes deal to buy Swiss Dairy.</title>
<headline>Suiza completes deal to buy Swiss Dairy.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suiza Foods Corp said Thursday it has completed its acquisition of Swiss Dairy for about $54 million.</p>
<p>In completing the deal, Suiza extended its $160 million credit line by $90 million, using about $45 million to fund the Swiss Dairy acquisition, the company said.</p>
<p>Suiza Foods is a Dallas-based holding company that consolidates distribution-oriented food businesses. Swiss Dairy is based in Riverside, Calif.</p>
